{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01889","headline":"杂曲歌辞 无愁果有愁曲 · 李商隐","name":"杂曲歌辞 无愁果有愁曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东有青龙西白虎，中含福皇包世度。\n玉壶渭水笑清潭，凿天不到牵牛处。\n骐驎踏云天马狞，牛山撼碎珊瑚声。\n秋娥点滴不成泪，十二玉楼无故钉。\n推烟唾月抛千里，十番红桐一行死。\n白杨别屋鬼迷人，空留暗记如蚕纸。\n日暮向风牵短丝，血凝血散今谁是。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}